{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/sc-03-coastal-discount-and-contact/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T22:16:12.619Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"2ad9272b91d999ccce0f05a08614d7f62e3f5d876f44177cdde51c4d480b3b2f","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#coastal-team","text":"Kwame, you're half right. On 2025-11-17 Bettina posted here that Saltmarsh's discount was 12%, then corrected it five minutes later to 10%. She had misread a draft worksheet from June Osei-Lark. So the last figure stated in this channel is 10%.\n\nThat's from last November, and I can't see a Saltmarsh contract, order form or amendment in the files I can read. I can't confirm 10% is still the current rate. For the renewal brief, check it with June on the deal desk.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
